  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia - Indonesia Partnership for Disaster Risk Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia - Indonesia Partnership for Disaster Risk Management also known as SIAP SIAGA focuses on strengthening humanitarian engagement between Australia and Indonesia and strengthening Indonesia&#x2019;s management of disaster risks. The program aims to improve Indonesia&#x2019;s management of disaster risks with a particular focus on strengthening Indonesia&#x2019;s coordination in preparing for, responding to and supporting recovery from disasters. This program will improve Australia&apos;s coordination and collaboration with Indonesia on regional humanitarian preparedness and responses.</narrative>
  </description>
